      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Montagio · HD 1080p, smooth motion\n\nA 480p, 16 fps clip becomes 1080p at 32 fps: SeedVR2 3B restores each frame in temporal chunks of 33, then RIFE 4.26 puts a frame between each two.\n\n**Tip:** The resize before SeedVR2 sets the output size (1920x1080 here).\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B)\n- `diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B)\n- `frame_interpolation/rife_v4.26.safetensors` (MIT, from hzwer/RIFE)\n\nCore nodes only. 410 s cold for 81 frames, RIFE 4.8 s of it, on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 8.6 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Montagio · HD 1080p, smooth motion\n\nA 480p, 16 fps clip becomes 1080p at 32 fps: SeedVR2 3B restores each frame in temporal chunks of 33, then RIFE 4.26 puts a frame between each two.\n\n**Tip:** The resize before SeedVR2 sets the output size (1920x1080 here).\n\n**Models**, under `ComfyUI/models/`:\n- `vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B)\n- `diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors` (Apache-2.0, from ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B)\n- `frame_interpolation/rife_v4.26.safetensors` (MIT, from hzwer/RIFE)\n\nCore nodes only. 410 s cold for 81 frames, RIFE 4.8 s of it, on an NVIDIA L4 (24 GB), peak 8.6 GB.\n\nOpen weights only: every file is Apache-2.0 or MIT, pinned by sha256 in Montagio's `registry/models.lock.yaml`."
      },
